# Frontend build configuration. Copy to `.env.local` (which is git-ignored) or
# set these in the host's build environment.
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* variables at BUILD time, not at runtime. Changing this
# after a build does nothing; rebuild.

# Where the API lives. Leave EMPTY for same-origin — that is what the dev proxy
# in vite.config.ts and a single-host deploy (e.g. a Vercel rewrite) both give
# you, and it is the setting with no CORS to get wrong.
#
# Set it to an absolute origin, with no trailing slash and no /api/v1 suffix,
# only when the frontend and the API are on different hosts:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://ufms-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
